PLACEHOLDER — this is not a licence.

Review Pace links against Anki, which is licensed AGPL-3.0, so the safe and
conventional choice for an add-on is the same licence. Replace this file with
the real text before building a release:

    curl -o LICENSE https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt

build.sh refuses to package until this file contains the actual licence.
